# Timing and accuracy reference, CPU half.
#
# 500 slices of SASE at ngrid=256, 10 m of the ARAMIS undulator, diagnostics
# every step. Identical to sase_gpu.in apart from rootname and the gpu flag,
# including the shot-noise seed.
#
#   mpirun -n 8 genesis4 sase_cpu.in
#
# Run sase_gpu.in at the SAME number of ranks before comparing: Genesis pads
# the slice count to a multiple of the rank count, and the shot-noise
# realization depends on how the slices are distributed, so a 1-rank run and an
# 8-rank run of this deck differ by ~7e-2 in Field/power on the CPU alone.

&setup
rootname=sase_cpu
lattice=Aramis.lat
beamline=ARAMIS
lambda0=1e-10
gamma0=11357.82
delz=0.045000
shotnoise=1
seed=1001
nbins=8
beam_global_stat=true
field_global_stat=true
&end

&lattice
zmatch=9.5
&end

&time
slen=4.0e-7
sample=8
&end

&field
power=0
dgrid=2.000000e-04
ngrid=256
waist_size=30e-6
&end

&beam
current=3000
delgam=1.000000
ex=4.000000e-07
ey=4.000000e-07
&end

&track
gpu=false
fft_fieldsolver=true
zstop=10
&end
